# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  YOUR PERSONAL TRAINING + HEALTH DATA — NEVER COMMITTED
#
#  This repo ships CODE ONLY. Everything the coach learns about you stays on your
#  machine. If you fork this and push, none of the paths below travel with it.
#
#  If you WANT your own data versioned, do it in a SEPARATE PRIVATE repo — never
#  by un-ignoring these lines in a public fork.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Athlete wiki — profile, body composition, labs, goals, coach notes
wiki.md
!templates/wiki-template.md

# Canonical coach state + weekly plans
state/
coach-state.json
dashboard/data/

# Long-term memory (may contain sensitive health context)
memory/

# Captured biometrics: glucose, sleep, HRV, rides, sessions
metrics/

# Generated charts + reports (contain your health data as images/HTML)
charts/
reports/
!reports/generate_*.py

# Route files — GPX start/end coordinates reveal home and workplace
routes/
*.gpx
*.tcx
*.fit

# Hevy routine exports
hevy_routines/

# Multi-user runtime data — other people's health data + the SQLite DB
data/

# ── Genetic data — raw exports NEVER commit ──
genome/
*genome*.txt
*23andme*
*23andMe*
*AncestryDNA*
*.vcf
*.vcf.gz
dna_raw*

# ── Secrets ──
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
.config/
*_api_key
*api_key*
.update-check.json

# ── Local machine / build artifacts ──
.claude/settings.local.json
node_modules/
dist/
build/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
dashboard/logs/*
!dashboard/logs/.gitkeep
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
